# EMBED Engine

This repository contains the EMBED Engine.

Production product surface:

- Embed Experience

Internal / non-product:

- Client Studio (Local) — developer workspace only
- Sales Studio / Manager Studio — separate studio surfaces when in scope

Every implementation must respect the architecture defined below and the **Embed First** directive.

---

# Architecture

The repository is a pnpm monorepo.

Applications live in:

apps/

Reusable packages live in:

packages/

Applications never contain business logic.

Business logic belongs only to packages — primarily `packages/core` and `packages/runtime` (Shared Runtime).

---

# Design Philosophy

The engine is not a website.

The engine is not a CMS.

The engine is a reusable runtime.

Every feature must increase reusability.

---

# Domain Driven Design

Business entities must remain framework independent.

No React imports.

No browser API.

No HTTP.

No UI.

Domain must be pure TypeScript.

---

# Package Rules

Packages may depend only downward.

Forbidden:

UI → App

Services → UI

Kernel → Services

Allowed:

Apps
↓

UI
↓

Services
↓

Kernel
↓

Contracts
↓

Model

---

# Naming

Folders

kebab-case

Classes

PascalCase

Interfaces

PascalCase

Functions

camelCase

Constants

UPPER_SNAKE_CASE

---

# Code Style

Small files.

Single responsibility.

Composition over inheritance.

No magic values.

No duplicated logic.

No dead code.

No commented code.

---

# Architecture Goal

The engine must remain usable for products other than real estate.

**Embed** is the canonical production Experience.

Client Studio (Local) is a developer shell — never the product reference.

Never hardcode real-estate assumptions into Kernel.

---

# Golden Rule

Whenever in doubt, simplify.

Architecture has priority over implementation speed.
